  "query_preview": "/SATURDAY THROUGH WEDNESDAY/...\nIssued at 226 AM CDT Thu Sep 10 2026\n\nThe weekend then looks to remain active with several additional \nchances for showers and storms from later Saturday into Sunday, and \nthen again with more widespread chances Sunday through Monday. \nAlthough temperatures remain in the 70s to 80s through the weekend \n(though with the higher dew points), we'll get one more bigger push \nof heat into Monday before cooling back into the 70s early next week \nbehind another cold front. Will continue to evaluate the potential \nfor severe storms and heavy rain with these subsequent rounds over \nthe coming days but conditions at first glance to remain more \nfavorable for heavy rain with pwats over 1.5\" through much of the \nweekend.",
